# What the images are built from: the sources, never local state or secrets.
#
# Without this file `COPY . .` took the whole working copy into the build —
# node_modules, and the .env with its secrets. Found on 2026-09-22, when the
# CI's clean checkout built differently from a laptop.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data
media
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
docs
apps/web/.certs
apps/web/public/tesseract
